SUMMARY:Join LLSA in celebrating Hispanic Heritage Month with a Latinx Le
 aders in Law Panel.
DESCRIPTION:Join LLSA in celebrating Hispanic Heritage Month with a Latin
 x Leaders in Law Panel. This panel will bring together several Latinx leg
 al professionals to discuss their career paths\, navigating the legal pro
 fession as Latinx attorneys\, advice for law students\, and current issue
 s affecting the profession.Panelists:  Professor Alvin Velazquez (https:/
 /law.indiana.edu/about/people/details?name=velazquez-alvin)  Professor Lu
 is Fuentes-Rohwer (https://law.indiana.edu/about/people/details?name=fuen
 tes-rohwer-luis)  Professor Nicholas Almendares (https://law.indiana.edu/
 about/people/details?name=almendares-nicholas)  Professor Elizabeth Truji
 llo (https://law.indiana.edu/about/people/details?name=trujillo-elizabeth
 )  &#160\;
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join LLSA in celebrating Hispanic Herit
 age Month with a Latinx Leaders in Law Panel. This panel will bring toget
 her several Latinx legal professionals to discuss their career paths\, na
 vigating the legal profession as Latinx attorneys\, advice for law studen
 ts\, and current issues affecting the profession.<br /><br /><span style=
 "text-decoration: underline\;"><strong>Panelists:</strong></span><br />  
 Professor <a href="https://law.indiana.edu/about/people/details?name=vela
 zquez-alvin">Alvin Velazquez</a><br />  Professor <a href="https://law.in
 diana.edu/about/people/details?name=fuentes-rohwer-luis">Luis Fuentes-Roh
 wer</a><br />  Professor <a href="https://law.indiana.edu/about/people/de
 tails?name=almendares-nicholas">Nicholas Almendares</a><br />  Professor 
 <a href="https://law.indiana.edu/about/people/details?name=trujillo-eliza
 beth">Elizabeth Trujillo</a></p><h2 class="title">  &#160\;</h2>
