SUMMARY:ILAP New Member Training
DESCRIPTION:Interested in being a member of ILAP?  Attend our New Member 
 Training\, where you will learn more about our organization\, the work we
  do\, and the necessary requirements for our new members! We will teach y
 ou about different ways incarcerated individuals ask for our assistance a
 nd what you can do as a first-year law student to put your new legal skil
 ls into practice.  If you are planning to be a member of ILAP\, this meet
 ing is mandatory.  RSVP below by 6:00 PM on September 14 to attend. Dinne
 r will be provided to all who RSVP!
