 p><p>  Attend our New Member Training\, where you will learn more about o
 ur organization\, the work we do\, and the necessary requirements for our
  new members! We will teach you about different ways incarcerated individ
 uals ask for our assistance and what you can do as a first-year law stude
 nt to put your new legal skills into practice.</p><p>  If you are plannin
 g to be a member of ILAP\, this meeting is mandatory.</p><p>  RSVP below 
 by 6:00 PM on September 14 to attend. Dinner will be provided to all who 
 RSVP!</p>
