SUMMARY:Volunteers in IP (VIP) Call Out
DESCRIPTION:Learn about the pro bono PatentConnect Volunteers in Intellec
 tual Property (VIP) program. This is a great way to earn pro bono hours w
 hile conducting prior art searches for inventors from Indiana and Kentuck
 y. NO hard science experience OR interest in IP is required to participat
 e! All necessary training is provided!  Do you have interest in innovatio
 n and entrepreneurship? This is a great opportunity for you!  Come find o
 ut more about PatentConnect and the VIP Program!
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Learn about the pro bono PatentConnect 
 Volunteers in Intellectual Property (VIP) program. This is a great way to
  earn pro bono hours while conducting prior art searches for inventors fr
 om Indiana and Kentucky. NO hard science experience OR interest in IP is 
 required to participate! All necessary training is provided!<br /><br /> 
  Do you have interest in innovation and entrepreneurship? This is a great
  opportunity for you!<br /><br />  Come find out more about PatentConnect
  and the VIP Program!</p>
