SUMMARY:Kangaroo Court
DESCRIPTION:Beginning at 7:00 p.m. on Thursday\, September 17th\, join th
 e Maurer Trial Team at Crazy Horse for food and a show before Bar Review!
  The Executive Board will be making fools of ourselves while we try a cas
 e\, and you\, the Jury\, can impose Sanctions to hinder us. Make Counsel 
 switch sides mid-argument\, force the Parties to object via rubber chicke
 n\, and bid on the opportunity to Pie the losing side!  Donations go towa
 rds lodging\, travel\, and registration expenses for external competition
 s and future MTT events/prizes. Tickets are $8 in advance\, $10 at the do
 or. Please Venmo Jamie-Emerson-8 with the caption "Kangaroo" to reserve y
 our seat.
