SUMMARY:X-Act Transactional Law Competition Informational Session
DESCRIPTION:Are you a dealmaker? No matter what field of law you're inter
 ested in\, if there are agreements to hash out\, you've got to draft them
  and negotiate the terms. This is Transactional Law. Maurer's X-Act ("exa
 ct!") Competition will teach you these skills and put them to the test. A
 nd you can win some hardware or a spot on the X-Act Transactional Team.
