 ld of law you're interested in\, if there are agreements to hash out\, yo
 u've got to draft them and negotiate the terms. This is Transactional Law
 . Maurer's X-Act ("exact!") Competition will teach you these skills and p
 ut them to the test. And you can win some hardware or a spot on the X-Act
  Transactional Team.</p>
