DESCRIPTION:Join us on Wednesday\, September 23rd from 12:00-1:00 pm in R
 oom 213 as we welcome Professor Ajay Mehrotra from Northwestern Universit
 y Pritzker School of Law to learn about Northwestern's Tax LLM Program.  
 At this session\, you can learn what advanced study in tax law at Northwe
 stern looks like\, including extensive curricular offerings from an exper
 t group of faculty and tax professionals\, networking and career opportun
 ities\, and flexible degree options.  Lunch will be provided to students 
 who RSVP.  If you are interested in attending\, you must RSVP by Septembe
 r 20. We look forward to seeing you there!
