DESCRIPTION:Join the Criminal Law Society and American Constitution Socie
 ty for a powerful Wrongful Conviction Day exoneree panel. The panel will 
 feature guest speaker Kristine Bunch\, Director of the Indiana Innocence 
 Project\, alongside other featured exonerees as they share their personal
  stories of navigating the criminal justice system and the fight for exon
 eration and reform. Lunch will be provided!
