BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:IU Maurer School of Law
DTSTART:20260928T160000Z
DTEND:20260928T170000Z
LOCATION:LOWELL E. BAIER HALL/IU MAURER SCHOOL OF LAW
GEO:39.165074;-86.526424
SUMMARY:Practitioner in Residence Talk: Legal Challenges in Cancer Diagno
 stics
DESCRIPTION:Navigating the intersection of patents\, regulation\, and com
 mercial strategy in cancer diagnostics requires a distinct legal strategy
 . Join us as Sarah Kelly\, Ph.D.\, J.D. shares how legal practice adapts 
 to rapid R&amp\;D\, evolving patent strategies\, restrictive profit margi
 ns (due to revenue depending on Medicare reimbursements)\, and data priva
 cy in this fast-paced field. Ms. Kelley's talk will include discussion of
  how her practice interacts with regulatory compliance\, privacy and data
  protection\, commercialization\, and reimbursement.&#160\;  Hosted by Ce
 nter for IP Research\, Maurer Health Law Student Association\, and the In
 tellectual Property Association  Lunch provided with RSVP by Friday\, Sep
 tember 25th.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Navigating the intersection of patents\
 , regulation\, and commercial strategy in cancer diagnostics requires a d
 istinct legal strategy. Join us as Sarah Kelly\, Ph.D.\, J.D. shares how 
 legal practice adapts to rapid R&amp\;D\, evolving patent strategies\, re
 strictive profit margins (due to revenue depending on Medicare reimbursem
 ents)\, and data privacy in this fast-paced field. Ms. Kelley's talk will
  include discussion of how her practice interacts with regulatory complia
 nce\, privacy and data protection\, commercialization\, and reimbursement
 .&#160\;</p><p>  Hosted by Center for IP Research\, Maurer Health Law Stu
 dent Association\, and the Intellectual Property Association</p><p>  Lunc
 h provided with RSVP by Friday\, September 25<sup>th</sup>.</p>
UID:20260928T160000Z-2314890@events.iu.edu
DTSTAMP:20260601T164850Z
