SUMMARY:Author Meets Reader - Pink Crime
DESCRIPTION:Join the Criminal Law Society\, Feminist Law Forum\, and OUTl
 aw for a conversation with Professor Valena Beety (https://law.indiana.ed
 u/about/people/details?name=beety-valena) about her latest book\, Pink Cr
 ime: Fighting Against the Criminalization of Motherhood\, Pregnancy\, and
  Queer Identity!
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join the Criminal Law Society\, Feminis
 t Law Forum\, and OUTlaw for a conversation with Professor <a href="https
 ://law.indiana.edu/about/people/details?name=beety-valena">Valena Beety</
